# Simulation build products.
#
# Patterns rather than the explicit list this used to be: that list needed a
# new entry for almost every target added, and a missed one shows up as a
# stray file in `git status` that somebody eventually commits by accident.
#
# sim/program.hex is the exception and is re-included below. It is the
# hand-assembled core regression program - tracked source, not a build
# product, and the reason `make sim` needs no RISC-V toolchain. It has already
# been deleted once by an over-broad glob; see sim/program.S.
sim/*.out
sim/*.vcd
sim/*.hex
sim/*.img
sim/*.log
sim/*.ppm
sim/*.bin
sim/*.elf
!sim/program.hex

# Build artifacts
obj_dir/
# Verilator's SoC harness, one directory per core (see VERILATOR_MDIR)
obj_dir_soc_*/
software/firmware.elf
software/firmware_text.bin
software/firmware_data.bin

# SoC build artifacts
software/soc/*.elf
software/soc/*.bin
dts/*.dtb
fpga/build/

# Local tool config (not shared)
.claude/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# Verification: upstream suites (fetched, not vendored) and their build output
tests/riscv-tests/
tests/build/
software/bench/coremark/
software/bench/coremark.elf
software/bench/coremark.bin
formal/build/

# FPGA build products (bitstream, PnR logs, synthesis JSON)
fpga/build/
